   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- Jesus Children of America segues into Stay, closing the listener's setlist [3]\n- Outrage is the opener and runs over into a second track [3]\n- Dig runs across two tracks, followed by One In Seven and Tuesday Night's Squad [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **soulive2009-02-13 dpa4023 1644 d1t01**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **soulive2009-02-13 dpa4023 1644 d1t02**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **soulive2009-02-13 dpa4023 1644 d1t03**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **soulive2009-02-13 dpa4023 1644 d1t04**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **soulive2009-02-13 dpa4023 1644 d1t05**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **soulive2009-02-13 dpa4023 1644 d1t06**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **soulive2009-02-13 dpa4023 1644 d1t07**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **soulive2009-02-13 dpa4023 1644 d1t08**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2009-02-13.dpa4023_16bit** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 83 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n- **soulive2009-02-13.dpa4023_24bit**: source not stated; 9 songs; 83 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2009-02-13.dpa4023_16bit**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Andy Murray; source: ORTF DPA 4023>V3>AD2K>HD-P@(24bit/48khz) [1]\n- **soulive2009-02-13.dpa4023_24bit**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Andy Murray; source: ORTF DPA 4023>V3>AD2K>HD-P@(24bit/48khz) [2]",
